      "message": "docs(process): agent roles trial - coordinator, Opus and Sonnet workers, Haiku context scouts\n\nAdds the coordinator and context-scout agents. Sets the max, high and\nmedium issue workers to Opus and the low worker to Sonnet. The work-issue\nskill sends a worker to a scout for its context. AGENTS.md states the\nroles as a trial.\n\nRefs #2464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
